{"id": "t090-005", "text": "Duc - works for Okafor Logistics, team lead on the warehouse side, been there about eight years. two kids (girls, 6 and 9), both at the primary on Otley Road. wife is Wei, she's a nurse at St James's, mostly nights. they live out in Horsforth near the park, his parents are just down the street and do a lot of the school runs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works for Okafor Logistics", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "team lead on the warehouse side", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "been there about eight years", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "girls", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "6 and 9", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the primary on Otley Road", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f8", "type": "FACT", "text": "nurse at St James's", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f9", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly nights", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f10", "type": "FACT", "text": "live out in Horsforth near the park", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f11", "type": "FACT", "text": "just down the street", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "f12", "type": "FACT", "text": "do a lot of the school runs", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r2"}]}
