{"id": "t090-012", "text": "Long chat with Kerry over coffee. Her new manager is a nightmare apparently, micromanages everything, wants hourly updates and copies himself into every email. Two people on her team have already handed their notice in. She's thinking about applying elsewhere, maybe going back to the NHS, and she's got a call with a recruiter on Thursday. I should send her that job ad Gemma forwarded me.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nightmare", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "micromanages everything", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about applying elsewhere", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "maybe going back to the NHS", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "call with a recruiter", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that job ad Gemma forwarded me", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
