{"id": "t090-023", "text": "Just had a really long call with Hugo about work. He's been put on the Lopez account, which is the big retail client everyone hates, and his manager Callum keeps dumping extra stuff on him late on Fridays. He's knackered, thinking about asking for a transfer to the Manchester office. Told him to talk to HR. I need to follow up in a couple of weeks and see if he did.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on the Lopez account", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about asking for a transfer to the Manchester office", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "follow up", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a couple of weeks", "anchor": "a1"}]}
