{"id": "t090-051", "text": "Bridget Adeyemi from the Okafor account rang this afternoon to say the contract renewal is going to be delayed till January, maybe mid January. She's annoyed with her finance team, they keep losing the paperwork. She's also off for two weeks from Friday, her colleague Mustafa will cover. Let the boss know tomorrow and email Mustafa an intro.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bridget Adeyemi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the Okafor account", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "contract renewal", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe mid January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "annoyed", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "colleague", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Let the boss know", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "email Mustafa an intro", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t090-052", "text": "Jack works nights at the hospital, so don't call before 2pm. Lives with his girlfriend Zoe in Chapel Allerton", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works nights at the hospital", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "don't call before 2pm", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Chapel Allerton", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t090-053", "text": "Xavier's mum passed away in the summer. He mentioned it today for the first time, still clearly cut up about it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Xavier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cut up", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t090-054", "text": "Voice memo. Okay so Arjun and Tamar are having a joint birthday barbecue next Sunday at Arjun's, weather permitting, if it rains they'll do it in the garage. Tamar said not to bring presents but she did say she's run out of that fancy gin she likes, so maybe. Also Arjun's brother Kenji is flying in from Tokyo for it which is nice.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint birthday barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "run out of that fancy gin she likes", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p6"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Tokyo", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p6"}]}
{"id": "t090-055", "text": "Gemma - new receptionist, very chatty, lives in Pudsey with her mum. Has a son called Oscar too, which is confusing", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "receptionist", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chatty", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Pudsey", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t090-056", "text": "hugo's band gig friday got called off, drummer broke his wrist", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "hugo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "friday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke his wrist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}]}
