{"id": "t090-058", "text": "Wei and Zhang have a dinner party Saturday 8pm, invited me and Nadia. They're doing hotpot. Nadia's coeliac so I said I'd mention it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 8pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p3"}]}
{"id": "t090-059", "text": "quiet one tonight, nothing much happened. finish the book, early night", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "finish the book", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "early night", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t090-060", "text": "Sana had her driving test this morning, third attempt, was so nervous beforehand. Ask her how it went when I see her at Kerry's dinner on Friday. Kerry also said her mum's down from Aberdeen this weekend, staying till next Tuesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her how it went", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see her", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "down from Aberdeen", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "till next Tuesday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
